  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285166,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nà zài è mèn fàn de guò chéng dāng zhōng ne\n那在呃焖饭的过程当中呢\nWhat about during the process of cooking rice?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288266,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
