    "tStartMs": 313633,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tā ne shì zhuān mén qiè gè zhǒng shū cài hé shuǐ guǒ de\n它呢是专门切各种蔬菜和水果的\nIt is specially used to cut various vegetables and fruits"
