    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546100,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "suǒ yǐ wǒ měi cì zhǐ fàng yì diǎn diǎn yì diǎn diǎn ń\n所以我每次只放一点点一点点嗯\nSo I only put a little bit at a time um"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550500,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hǎo wǒ men xiàn zài děng yóu rè yì diǎn\n好我们现在等油热一点\nOkay, let's wait for the oil to get hotter."
