  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591233,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nà jì rán shì má pó dòu fǔ\n那既然是麻婆豆腐\nThen since it is Mapo Tofu"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593700,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tā jiù yí dìng yào yǒu là jiāo là jiāo\n它就一定要有辣椒辣椒\nIt has to have chili peppers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597100,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nǐ men hěn duō rén zhī qián gēn wǒ jiǎng\n你们很多人之前跟我讲\nMany of you have told me before"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598933,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
